msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/0e231d46-e185-42c7-a7f6-33b784f4a8f2-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
